{"id":"8d1d3e8d27bdd222","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Infinitary Language","display":"df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language — ZFC Logic9 Infinitary Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language — ZFC Logic9 Infinitary Language","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-infinitary-language — ZFC Logic9 Infinitary Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal F,\\kappa,\\lambda,B,C,I,\\Phi,\\vec x\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal F,\\kappa,\\lambda,B,C,I,\\Phi,\\vec x\\in V\\)</span> (language, formula sets, cardinals, and syntax-code data)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (atomic formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{conj},\\mathtt{all}\\in V\">\\(\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{conj},\\mathtt{all}\\in V\\)</span> are pairwise distinct constructor tags, with\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neg}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{Neg}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle\\)</span>,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conj}_{\\mathcal L}(I,\\Phi):=\\langle\\mathtt{conj},I,\\Phi\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{Conj}_{\\mathcal L}(I,\\Phi):=\\langle\\mathtt{conj},I,\\Phi\\rangle\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}_{\\mathcal L}(\\vec x,\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{all},\\vec x,\\varphi\\rangle\">\\(\\operatorname{All}_{\\mathcal L}(\\vec x,\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{all},\\vec x,\\varphi\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S\\)</span> (bounded closure predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>合取索引统一采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(I\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|I|&lt;\\kappa\">\\(|I|&lt;\\kappa\\)</span> 的集合编码；不允许把任意秩的等势标签直接写入语法码。三个构造子标签除彼此不同外，其编码像与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 不交。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(C,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nC\\subseteq B\n\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq C\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;(\\operatorname{Neg}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall I\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall\\Phi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,I,C)\\land|I|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\\operatorname{Conj}_{\\mathcal L}(I,\\Phi)\\in C\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in V\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec x,\\delta,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\to\\operatorname{All}_{\\mathcal L}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\in C\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(C,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nC\\subseteq B\n\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq C\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;(\\operatorname{Neg}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall I\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall\\Phi\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Phi,I,C)\\land|I|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\\operatorname{Conj}_{\\mathcal L}(I,\\Phi)\\in C\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in V\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec x,\\delta,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\to\\operatorname{All}_{\\mathcal L}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\in C\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}language} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\omega\\leq\\lambda\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(B,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathcal F=\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(B)\\mid\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(C,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}language} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InfinitaryLanguage}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\omega\\leq\\lambda\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(B,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\n\\mathcal F=\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(B)\\mid\n\\mathrm{InfClosed}_S(C,B,\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\}\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该文件保留原来的可数变量集及量词块约定，只修补集合编码边界。若让 I 遍历所有小基数但任意秩的集合，则码中直接包含 I，使任何候选闭包 B 都不是集合；现以 κ 内部的索引集合消除此障碍。不同索引标签可通过双射重编号，不改变其所表示的合取。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)$ (atomic formulas, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ (variable-symbol set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal F,\\kappa,\\lambda,B,C,I,\\Phi,\\vec x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{conj},\\mathtt{all}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Neg}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conj}_{\\mathcal L}(I,\\Phi):=\\langle\\mathtt{conj},I,\\Phi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{All}_{\\mathcal L}(\\vec x,\\varphi):=\\langle\\mathtt{all},\\vec x,\\varphi\\rangle",